---
const COVERAGE_ROWS = [
  { city: '上海', type: '上海', time: '参考次日达', note: '具体以线路和合同SLA为准' },
  { city: '苏州 / 无锡 / 南京', type: '江苏', time: '参考次日达', note: '具体以线路和合同SLA为准' },
  { city: '杭州 / 宁波 / 义乌', type: '浙江', time: '参考次日达', note: '具体以线路和合同SLA为准' },
  { city: '合肥 / 芜湖', type: '安徽', time: '参考次日达', note: '具体以线路和合同SLA为准' },
  { city: '福州 / 厦门', type: '福建', time: '参考次日达', note: '具体以线路和合同SLA为准' },
]
---

<section class="py-14 bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100" aria-labelledby="coverage-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 id="coverage-heading" class="text-xl font-black text-navy-800 mb-1 text-center">
      华东仓配送时效覆盖
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-center mb-8">上海青浦发出，覆盖长三角及华东主要城市</p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
      <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-navy-800 text-white">
            <th class="px-5 py-3.5 font-bold text-xs tracking-wider">城市 / 区域</th>
            <th class="px-5 py-3.5 font-bold text-xs tracking-wider">所属省份</th>
            <th class="px-5 py-3.5 font-bold text-xs tracking-wider">参考时效</th>
            <th class="px-5 py-3.5 font-bold text-xs tracking-wider hidden sm:table-cell">说明</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 bg-white">
          {
            COVERAGE_ROWS.map(({ city, type, time, note }) => (
              <tr class="hover:bg-orange-50/20 transition-colors">
                <td class="px-5 py-4 font-bold text-navy-700 text-xs">{city}</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 text-gray-500 text-xs">{type}</td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 text-xs">
                  <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold text-[10px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-500">
                    {time}
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-5 py-4 text-gray-400 text-xs hidden sm:table-cell">{note}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3">
      * 以上时效为参考值，以实际合同SLA条款为准。具体快递覆盖及时效请联系商务团队确认。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
